// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Diff line highlighting in DeepReview mode
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Applied by ``ui/editor.nim``'s ``deepReviewDiffStyleLines`` (via the
// existing ``styleLines`` / ``deltaDecorations`` pattern) when a source file
// is opened while a review is active and the review data carries hunks for
// it — DeepReview-GUI.md §5.1, "Full Files Mode ... diff highlights applied
// to the modified lines".  Added lines in a pure-addition hunk are green,
// added lines in a hunk that also removes are yellow.
//
// Same green/yellow palette as the unified diff tab
// (``components/unified_diff.styl``) so the two representations of one
// changeset read alike.  Moved here from the deleted
// ``components/deepreview.styl`` (DR-R8); the editor is their only consumer.

.line-diff-added
  background-color: rgba(63, 185, 80, 0.18)
  border-left: 0.1875em solid #3fb950

.line-diff-modified
  background-color: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.18)
  border-left: 0.1875em solid #d29922

.line-diff-removed
  background-color: rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.18)
  border-left: 0.1875em solid #f85149
